The Switch account tile
29a-sd-tcl-the-home-screen
Lists the accounts the person may enter and shows the home screen of the one chosen. The rule is the one logto uses: an administrator may enter any account, anyone else the accounts of their own Linux group; never a suspended account and never SDSYS.
Turned off, the tile is missing from this account's home screen and its menu entry cannot be chosen. The person can still type logto at a prompt they have.
